BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 758.9000000000001 Td (- Stress sigma = F/A; longitudinal strain epsilon = Delta L/L \(dimensionless\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 747.0000000000001 Td (- Young's modulus Y = \(F/A\)/\(Delta L/L\) = FL/\(A Delta L\), so Delta L = FL/\(AY\).) Tj ET
