BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 723.2000000000002 Td (- Shear modulus G = shear stress/shear strain; shear strain approximately x/L for small deformation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 711.3000000000002 Td (- Hooke's law: stress proportional to strain within the proportional limit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 699.4000000000002 Td (- For a cube, volume strain = Delta V/V; for small uniform linear compression, use the stated volume change) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 687.5000000000002 Td (directly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48 675.6000000000003 Td (- Stress and elastic moduli are in Pa \(N/m^2\); strain has no unit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 48 663.7000000000003 Td (Use equations only when their assumptions apply; keep units consistent.) Tj ET
